close_reason: "All eleven round-3 threads addressed: byte-order canonical sorting at three hash-feeding sites (transfer.ts gaps, gatesim.ts gate results and stored episodes), duplicate normalized library names refused in receipts, MAX_SWEEP_ARMS cap with typed search_space_too_large refusal, one shared metric-name pattern, --receipt-file declared on rl run start, typed refusal codes and no-write state assertions pinned in tests, README type table completed to all nine types, and per_metric NaN-hole documented. Gates: npm test 235/235 pass; release:check fully green including coverage 17 files at 100/100/100 and changelog check; ./node_modules/.bin/pm health --strict-exit exit 0. Every behavioural fix revert-verified: pinned test confirmed failing under git stash of the fix, passing restored."
